      "item": "Content vs. metadata",
      "question": "Do you want full message/transcript bodies or just metadata? If content is included, specify any redaction rules."
    },
    {
      "item": "Sensitive data handling",
      "question": "Confirm whether to include masked/tokens only for payment instruments and exclude any PAN/secret data (we typically only provide tokens/last4)."
    },
    {
      "item": "Geographic/regulatory constraints",
      "question": "Are there data residency or transfer limits (e.g., GDPR, HIPAA) we must enforce?"
    },
    {
      "item": "Exact date range",
      "question": "Please confirm start and end dates for the 6‑month window and the timezone for timestamp cutoffs."
    },
    {
      "item": "Identifiers",
      "question": "Include internal IDs and customer IDs for joinability? Any specific join keys required?"
    },
    {
      "item": "File packaging",
      "question": "OK to deliver multiple CSVs (one per object) compressed (.zip or .gz)? Preferences for delimiter (comma), quoting, null representation, and line endings?"
    },
    {
      "item": "Approvals",
      "question": "Please provide the approving manager’s email and any ticket/change ID to attach to the request."
    }
